<blockquote class="uncited"><div>I ordered the 5W/GPS version of the MD-UV390 Plus from buytwowayradios.com but received the 10W version without GPS. It doesn't appear that they have control over the stock of their radios. I thought I was ordering from a reputable place. Can anyone recommend a better source for the 5W/GPS version of this radio? I understand that at this time it is not a supported radio.</div></blockquote>People reported that the original production run of UV390 PLUS radios worked OK with the firmware, but in the last 2 or 3 weeks multiple people bought new radios which don't appear to work.<br><br>We don't know why this is, and presume that the latest batch of UV390 PLUS must have some hardware differences<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Tue Jan 09, 2024 11:01 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
